+# Invoice review service
+
+## Purpose
+
+This project reviews invoice line items and returns findings for a human finance operator. It never authorizes or sends a payment.
+
+## Established behavior
+
+- Invoice lines contain a string reference and an amount in cents.
+- `findDuplicateInvoiceReferences` identifies references that occur more than once and returns each duplicated reference once, sorted lexicographically.
+
+## Evidence boundary
+
+The README also describes arithmetic-mismatch review, but the current source does not establish an implementation for that behavior.
